WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.908
Welcome to QuickInsight’s Question Builder. Start with a measure, like sales, and choose how to calculate it. Sum adds the matching sales values.

00:00:11.058 --> 00:00:21.745
For a monthly trend, choose Month in the Time tab. The chart updates automatically, and the colour shades make lower and higher sales easier to spot.

00:00:21.895 --> 00:00:31.883
Switch to Product to compare categories. Each product gets a distinct colour. The plain-English answer says what the visual is showing.

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:42.411
Need more context? Open Options and add Profit as another measure. You can compare both numbers in one visual without building a new question.

00:00:42.561 --> 00:00:52.729
If Profit is not needed, remove it from the same Options menu. The visual returns to Sales, and Profit remains available to add again.

00:00:52.879 --> 00:01:02.962
Filter to the product you want to inspect. Sorting and limits are also available in Options. Every change recalculates the answer.

00:01:03.112 --> 00:01:14.044
Drag the divider to give the chart more room. In Style, Auto chooses value shades for time and distinct colours for categories, but you can override it.

00:01:14.194 --> 00:01:23.242
When the answer is ready, choose Pin. Give the visual a clear title, then choose or create the dashboard where it belongs.

00:01:23.392 --> 00:01:32.370
The finished visual now lives on your dashboard. You can revisit it, refresh it, or keep exploring the data with another question.
